          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Unless otherwise stated in this proxy statement/prospectus or the context otherwise requires, all references in this proxy statement/prospectus to KINS Class&#160;A Common Stock, shares of New CXApp Common Stock or KINS Warrants include such securities underlying the KINS Units. </font>
