            <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Goodwill represents the excess of total consideration over the estimated fair value of the net assets acquired and is largely attributable to synergies and acquired workforce. Approximately $39.4&#160;million has been allocated to goodwill pursuant to the preliminary purchase price allocation. </font>
