ity-based awards covering or convertible into any shares of other equity interests in CXApp or any of CXApp&#8217;s subsidiaries or other equity interests of CXApp or any of CXApp&#8217;s subsidiaries, the value of which is determined by reference to shares or other equity interests of CXApp or any of CXApp&#8217;s subsidiaries; </font>
