        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:7.11pt; width:456pt; line-height:11.5pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Based on the management discussion and internal analysis of various factors including technology, intellectual property, business products, historical and current business performance and current business plan, the Enterprise Apps Business&#8217;s enterprise value is estimated applying the lower ranges (first quartile) multiples for the comparable companies for 2022E and NTM period. Based on this, the enterprise value for the Enterprise Apps Business is estimated between $54.0&#160;million and $63.9&#160;million. </font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:12pt; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;font-style:italic;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Selected Transactions Analysis</font><font style="font-style:normal;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
