        <div style="margin-top:18.2pt; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;font-weight:bold;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:-0.2pt;">Cash Flows from Investing Activities as of September&#160;30, 2022 and 2021</font><font style="font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:12.5pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Net cash flows used in investing activities during the nine&#160;months ended September&#160;30, 2022 was approximately $0.4&#160;million compared to net cash flows used in investing activities during the nine&#160;months ended September&#160;30, 2021 of approximately $15.5&#160;million. Cash flows related to investing activities during the nine&#160;months ended September&#160;30, 2022 include $0.1&#160;million for the purchase of property and equipment, and $0.3&#160;million for investment in capitalized software. Cash flows related to investing activities during the nine&#160;months ended September&#160;30, 2021 include $0.1&#160;million for the purchase of property and equipment, $0.2&#160;million for investment in capitalized software, $15.2&#160;million of cash paid for the CXApp acquisition and $0.1&#160;million of cash paid for the Visualix acquisition. </font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:12pt; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;font-weight:bold;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:-0.2pt;">Cash Flows from Financing Activities as of September&#160;30, 2022 and 2021</font><font style="font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:12.5pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Net cash flows provided by financing activities during the nine&#160;months ended September&#160;30, 2022 was $16.9&#160;million. Net cash flows provided by financing activities during the nine&#160;months ended September&#160;30, 2021 was $29.9&#160;million. During the nine&#160;months ended September&#160;30, 2022, the Company received incoming cash flows from Parent of $19.0&#160;million, paid $0.1&#160;million of taxes related to the net share settlement of restricted stock&#160;units, and paid a $2.0&#160;million liability related to the CXApp acquisition. During the nine&#160;months ended September&#160;30, 2021, the Company received incoming cash flows from Parent of $31.2&#160;million, paid a $0.2&#160;million liability related to the CXApp acquisition, paid $0.5&#160;million of taxes related to the net share settlement of restricted stock&#160;units and paid a $0.5&#160;million acquisition liability to the pre-acquisition stockholders of Locality. </font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:12pt; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">
