            <td style="padding:0pt; width:6pt;">&#8203;</td>
            <td style="padding:1.917pt 0pt 2.5pt 0pt; width:112pt;">
              <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">The Existing Charter authorized 220,000,000 shares, consisting of (a)&#160;220,000,000 shares of common stock, including (i)&#160;200,000,000 shares of KINS Class&#160;A common stock, and (ii)&#160;20,000,000 shares of KINS Class&#160;B common stock, and (b)&#160;2,000,000 shares of undesignated preferred stock. </font>
            </td>
            <td style="padding:0pt; width:6pt;">&#8203;</td>
            <td style="padding:0pt; width:6pt;">&#8203;</td>
            <td style="padding:1.917pt 0pt 2.5pt 0pt; width:112pt;">
              <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">The Proposed Charter decreases the total number of authorized shares of all classes of capital stock to 212,000,000 shares, consisting of (i)&#160;200,000,000 shares of Class&#160;A Common Stock, (ii)&#160;10,000,000 shares of Class&#160;C Common Stock, and (iii)&#160;2,000,000 shares of undesignated preferred stock, each having a par value of $0.0001. Upon consummation of the Business Combination, we expect there will be approximately 7,589,999 shares of Class&#160;A Common Stock outstanding and 6,210,000 shares of Class&#160;C Common Stock outstanding, assuming no redemptions and no </font>
            </td>
            <td style="padding:0pt; width:6pt;">&#8203;</td>
            <td style="padding:0pt; width:6pt;">&#8203;</td>
            <td style="padding:1.917pt 0pt 2.5pt 0pt; width:112pt;">
              <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Under Inpixon&#8217;s articles of incorporation, Inpixon is currently authorized to issue 31,666,667 shares, consisting of (a)&#160;26,666,667 shares of common stock, par value $0.001 per share, and (b)&#160;5,000,000 shares of preferred stock, par value $0.001 per share. </font>
            </td>
            <td style="padding:0pt; width:0pt;">&#8203;</td>
          </tr>
