        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:12.6pt; width:456pt; line-height:11.5pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">In connection with the Acquisition, the Company is to pay an additional amount up to $12.5&#160;million to certain select sellers of CXApp shares (payable in shares of the Parent&#8217;s common stock based on a per </font>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top:2.00000000000002pt;height:12pt;margin-left:69.66pt;width:456pt;">
        <div style="margin-top:5pt; text-align:center; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">&#160;</font>
          <br >
        </div>
