        <div style=" margin-top:5.9pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12pt; text-align:left; margin-left:30pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">The Company increased the provisional fair value of deferred taxes by $1.9&#160;million with a corresponding decrease to goodwill. </font>
        </div>
