        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:13pt; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Lease expense for operating leases recorded in the balance sheet is included in operating costs and expenses and is based on the future minimum lease payments recognized on a straight-line basis over the term of the lease plus any variable lease costs. Operating lease expenses, inclusive of short-term and variable lease expenses, recognized in our consolidated statement of income for the period ended December&#160;31, 2021 and 2020 was $0.6&#160;million and $0.8&#160;million, respectively. </font>
        </div>
        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">During the&#160;years ended December&#160;31, 2021 and 2020 , the Company recorded $0.4&#160;million and $0.5&#160;million, respectively, as rent expense to the right-of-use assets. </font>
        </div>
      </div>
