          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">subsidiary, Philippines entity and its majority-owned India subsidiary. Cash in foreign financial institutions as of September&#160;30, 2022 and December&#160;31, 2021 was immaterial. The Company has not experienced any losses and believes it is not exposed to any significant credit risk from cash.</font><font style="font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:-0.2pt;"> </font>
