        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:9.2pt; width:456pt; line-height:12.5pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">As of September&#160;30, 2022, three customers represented approximately 51% of total accounts receivable. As of September&#160;30, 2021, there were four customers represented approximately 63% of total accounts receivable. </font>
        </div>
        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:12.5pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">As of September&#160;30, 2022, three vendors represented approximately 38% of total gross accounts payable. Purchases from these vendors during the nine&#160;months ended September&#160;30, 2022 was approximately $1.0&#160;million. As of September&#160;30, 2021, three vendors represented approximately 48% of total gross accounts payable. Purchases from these vendors during the nine&#160;months ended September&#160;30, 2021 was approximately $1.3&#160;million. </font>
        </div>
        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:13pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">For the nine&#160;months ended September&#160;30, 2022, one vendor represented approximately 33% of total purchases. For the nine&#160;months ended September&#160;30, 2021, there were no vendor that exceeded 10% of total purchases.</font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:12pt; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;font-weight:bold;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:-0.2pt;">Note 13&#8201;&#8212;&#8201;Foreign Operations</font><font style="font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:12.5pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">The Company&#8217;s operations are located primarily in the United States, Canada, India, Germany, Ireland, Philippines, and the United Kingdom. Revenues by geographic area are attributed by country of domicile of our subsidiaries. The financial data by geographic area are as follows (in thousands): </font>
        </div>
