        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:12pt; width:456pt; line-height:11.5pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Lease expense for operating leases recorded in the balance sheet is included in operating costs and expenses and is based on the future minimum lease payments recognized on a straight-line basis over the term of the lease plus any variable lease costs. Operating lease expenses, inclusive of short-term and variable lease expenses, recognized in our consolidated statement of income for the nine&#160;months ended September&#160;30, 2022 and 2021 was $0.5&#160;million and $0.4&#160;million, respectively. </font>
        </div>
