        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:5.5pt; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">8.5&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</font><font style=" text-decoration:underline #000000 solid;letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Consents</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Any consent required or permitted to be given by any Party to the other Parties under this Agreement shall be in writing and signed by the Party giving such consent and shall be effective only against such Party (and its Group). </font>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top:2.00000000000002pt;height:12pt;margin-left:69.66pt;width:456pt;">
