              <td style="padding:2.167pt 0pt 0.833pt 0pt; width:408pt;white-space:normal;">
                <div style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">
                  <a style="-sec-extract:exhibit" href="https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1820875/000110465922124935/kinzu-20220930xs4a.htm#AnnexA">Agreement and Plan of Merger, dated as of September&#160;25, 2022, by and among KINS, KINS Merger Sub Inc., Inpixon, and CXApp (included as Annex A to the proxy statement/prospectus)</a>
                </div>
              </td>
